WEBVTT

00:03:28.246 --> 00:03:32.250
about how having nice things
said about you while you're alive

00:03:32.291 --> 00:03:34.043
beats the alternative,

00:03:34.085 --> 00:03:35.711
I wrote my dad a letter.

00:03:36.545 --> 00:03:39.632
And the theme of the letter
reflected a common thread

00:03:39.632 --> 00:03:42.134
that I had noticed in his long life.

00:03:42.176 --> 00:03:43.844
The theme of building.

00:03:44.553 --> 00:03:48.015
Our dad had helped to build
so many things.

00:03:49.225 --> 00:03:52.812
Gun emplacements in World War II;

00:03:52.812 --> 00:03:55.606
a new industrial park;

00:03:55.648 --> 00:04:00.945
a vibrant hobby as a self-taught
and later acclaimed woodcarver;